And there's all these different ideas about weight loss.

113
00:06:37,708 --> 00:06:40,741
And I couldn't figure out what the correct one was.

114
00:06:40,741 --> 00:06:42,812
Because everyone's like, arguing with everyone.

115
00:06:42,812 --> 00:06:44,018
And I found this one guy.

116
