123
00:07:07,732 --> 00:07:09,549
You got to dream big.

124
00:07:09,549 --> 00:07:12,798
He's like, think big. What are your body goals?

125
00:07:12,798 --> 00:07:22,949
And I was like, I would love to gain two foot.

126
00:07:22,949 --> 00:07:28,117
My dream to be five foot five.

127
00:07:28,117 --> 00:07:30,391
I'm good. I'm doing well.

128
